  "created": "2026-11-04T18:34:47.017Z",
  "description": "The Windows shell of Shenora, the hybrid app framework for .NET + React: application bootstrapper with global exception handling, DPI-correct window-state persistence, one instance per install, a later launch handing the running app its arguments, secondary windows on their own STA threads, tray icon, frameless-chrome form, the main form's system animations on or off, a native launcher's startup screen closed once the main form shows, and the Windows implementations of the Shenora shell contracts (STA file dialogs, clipboard, UI-thread dispatcher). Hosts WebView2: environment prewarm, dev-server vs packaged-frontend loading, navigation/new-window/download/permission/process-failure handling, a page of the app's own for a page load that finds nothing, drag-drop zones, the app's colour scheme set on the profile of each WebView given it, and the postMessage IPC bridge with batched event push. Hosts Chromium the same way, through Shenora.Chromium: a ChromiumView control, with UseChromiumEngine running CEF beside the WinForms loop; reference Shenora.Chromium from the app itself, since CEF arrives only through that package's build. Hosts the auxiliary browser sessions (Shenora.Core.Sessions) in WebView2: WebView2SessionHost makes their off-screen browsers and an interactive session's modal window.",
  "iconFile": "shenora-icon.png",
